        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9465, 1/2\" Diameter Stainless Steel Slim Line Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1/2 Inch Diameter Stainless Steel Slim Line Cabinet Pull is available in 7 different sizes from 5-3/4 inches to 32-1/4 inches overall length. This stainless steel cabinet hardware is designed to accentuate any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired. Made from the highest grade material available, every Omnia piece is strong, durable, and resistant to corrosion and staining. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/14-mm-diameter-slim-line-round-brushed-stainless-steel-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9465\"><b>14 mm Diameter Slim Line Round Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>9465/96</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1/2\" (14mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9465/128</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1/2\" (14mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9465/192</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1/2\" (14mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9465/320</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1/2\" (14mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<